  =============================================================================
 * Tick Auto-Correct (240 TPS) - Mobile & Desktop Geode Mod for Geometry Dash
 * =============================================================================
 * Features:
 *  1. 240 TPS Physics Tick Tracking & Rolling 16-Tick State Ring Buffer:
 *     Records full deterministic snapshots of Player 1 & Player 2 state
 *     across the last 16 physics ticks at 240 TPS (dt = 1/240s = 4.167ms).
 *  2. Early & Late Click Auto-Correction (±1 to ±16 Ticks):
 *     - When you click (press/release) or hit a fatal click check:
 *       * Tests if the raw click at tick T survives the next 480 ticks @ 240 TPS.
 *       * If it fails (dies within 480 ticks), searches offsets Δ in [-W, +W]
 *         (where W is configurable from 1 to 16 ticks):
 *         - Late Click (Δ = -1 .. -W): Rewinds to snapshot T - k, applies the
 *           click at T - k, verifies survival for 480 ticks at 240 TPS, and
 *           fast-forwards k ticks back to T.
 *         - Early Click (Δ = +1 .. +W): Suppresses the premature click at T,
 *           verifies that firing the click at T + k survives for 480 ticks at
 *           240 TPS, and schedules the corrected click for tick T + k.
 *  3. Mobile-Friendly In-Game UI (PauseLayer Popup + HUD + Geode Settings):
 *     - Adds a "TC" (Tick Correct) button to the Pause Menu that opens a
 *       touch-friendly interactive Popup allowing you to choose from 1-16
 *       ticks via a Slider, -/+ single-tick steppers, and 1t/4t/8t/12t/16t
 *       preset buttons, plus toggles for Early, Late, Death Rescue, and HUD.
 * ============================================================================
 */

